    "detailed_description": "<strong>Manual Overcycle </strong> is the evolution of bicycle gameplay. With it's unique physics-based gameplay, bicycle gamers finally have the expressive controls they have always dreamed of.<br><br>Dive into bicycle paradise with levels that feature famous bicycle landmarks and environmental elements. <br><br><strong>Manual Overcycle features include:</strong><br><br><strong>Freedom Of Expression </strong>- Manual Overcycle\u2019s physics-based controls don\u2019t have any pre-programmed tricks - only the movement through the keyboard keys.<br><br><strong>Revolutionary Controls</strong> - Manual Overycle puts you in complete control of your bike, whether its on the ground, in the air, or grinding down a handrail. The perfect balance of accessibility and depth, the control system allows you fully express yourself, from learning the basics to pushing the limits.<br><br><strong>Explore</strong> - Manual Overcycle offers some cool maps for players to explore.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Physics Based Bicycle Riding <br></li><li>Modern Control System<br></li><li>Replay Editor <br></li><li>Cool Maps<br></li><li>Day-Night Cycles <br></li><li>Photo Mode</li></ul>",
